0..75 Comment "// This source drives an endpoint through a recursive protocol with a loop."
76..78 Comment "//"
79..125 Comment "// Each loop turn completes one protocol pass."
126..162 Comment "// One fixpoint supplies the passes."
163..224 Comment "// An outer binding would capture the endpoint in every pass."
225..284 Comment "// The loop threads the endpoint as it threads a held slot."
285..336 Comment "// A pass acts on its endpoint before it continues."
337..339 Comment "//"
340..393 Comment "// The lowering gives the endpoint to the first pass."
394..436 Comment "// The loop head holds the starting state."
437..486 Comment "// `continue` returns the endpoint at that state."
487..523 Comment "// Such a loop follows its protocol."
524..557 Comment "// Such a loop owes no `Partial`."
558..560 Comment "//"
561..576 Comment "// - see: #4502"
577..592 Comment "// - see: #4705"
594..641 Comment "/// `follow` receives reports until retirement."
642..695 Comment "/// Retirement closes the endpoint and ends the loop."
